#. Label of the financing_all_operating (Check) field in DocType 'PSAK ID
#. Company Policy'
#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_company_policy/psak_id_company_policy.json:111
msgid "All Financing Expenses in Operating"
msgstr "Seluruh Beban Pendanaan di Operasi"

#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_company_policy/psak_id_company_policy.py:28
msgid "All Financing Expenses in Operating can only be ticked when customer financing is a main business activity of the company. Tick Main Business: Customer Financing first."
msgstr "Seluruh Beban Pendanaan di Operasi hanya bisa dicentang bila pembiayaan pelanggan adalah aktivitas utama perusahaan. Centang dulu Aktivitas Utama: Pembiayaan Pelanggan."

#. Description of the 'Other Items Threshold' (Section Break) field in DocType
#. 'PSAK ID Company Policy'
#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_company_policy/psak_id_company_policy.json:162
msgid "An Other Items line above the threshold must be explained in a note before the statement can be sent for review. When both are set, the smaller one applies."
msgstr "Pos Lain-lain yang melebihi ambang wajib dijelaskan di catatan sebelum laporan bisa diajukan review. Bila keduanya diisi, yang lebih kecil yang berlaku."

